#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Autonomous 2-Agent Closed-Loop Engineering System
==================================================

Architecture:
- Agent 1 (Orchestrator / Notion Master & QA Tester):
    * Holds full system blueprint (loaded from JSON or Notion checklist export).
    * Dispatches topics sequentially within target scope [start_topic_id, end_topic_id].
    * Evaluates code generated by Agent 2 against blueprint criteria, UX requirements,
      and automated terminal test validations.
    * If criteria are unmet, generates actionable feedback with exact error logs and prompts Agent 2 to iterate.
- Agent 2 (Worker / Frontend & UX-UI Coder):
    * Receives topic requirements, context, and iterative QA feedback.
    * Writes, updates, and saves production-ready UI/UX code files to disk.
    * Returns execution status and file manifest to Agent 1.

Guardrails:
- Strict max iteration cap per topic (default 3 to 5 attempts) to prevent infinite loops.
- Self-correction prompt injection with exact terminal logs and QA feedback.
- Configurable target scope (start_topic_id -> end_topic_id).
"""

